# OneOS package set infinityx: sha256sum of out/overlays_infinityx_r12 (scripts/make-overlays.sh, 2026-10-29; services_patched.jar with patches/guest_sec_ims_signature.py; 2026-10-31 OneOSPixelStatusBar.apk; 0.4.39 r3: services_patched.jar with patches/guest_ksu_manager_appid.py, 2026-11-03), minus tethering_payload.img and cellbroadcast_payload.img (One UI's modules stay, 0.4.28; 0.4.55 r4: services_patched.jar with patches/guest_secims_path_upgrade.py, framework_patched.jar with patches/guest_secims_members.py, telephony-common_patched.jar (the image's, patches/guest_smsc_international.py), samcam.tar (the Galaxy S26 Ultra's camera, build-cached.sh SAMCAM_BAR=1), 2026-11-05; 0.4.57 r5: samcam.tar with fix_notification_icon.py; 0.4.58 r6: samcam.tar with the patched scamera_sdk_util.jar again, telephony-common + guest_sms_invalid_response.py, oplus-services + oplus_zen_light.py; 0.4.59 r7: samcam.tar keeps videos on Stop (fix_recorder_track_started.py); 0.4.59 r7: samcam.tar with the gallery fallback (fix_gallery_fallback.py); 0.4.59 r7: samcam.tar with the recording timer and secmedia fallback; 0.4.59 r8: samcam.tar with the camera timer, secmedia queries and gallery fallback; 0.4.59 r9: samcam.tar with the video rotation written after the stop; 0.4.61 r12: samcam.tar with the A phones' settings the S26 Ultra's camera does not know (fix_a_series_modes.py)).
